{"labs": [{"stimuli": [{"id": 0, "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le06ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le06ob04re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le06ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Good morning, I'm Denise Moore, CEO of BFP Publishing.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Pleased to meet you, I'm Adam Bari.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: And I'm Kristi Lenard.<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Welcome to BFP Publishing. My job will be to make sure your transition goes as smoothly and seamlessly as possible. Please, take this chair. We share furniture around here.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: So far, we're off to a great start.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le06ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Three people will share this office space. You have a lovely view of the tree outside. Now, I'd like to have a little t\u00eate-\u00e0-t\u00eate about some company policies so you know exactly what is expected from you. Let's start by talking about what it means to be reliable.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Sure.<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: We want to build a trusting work environment. We don't want to always ask for updates. The counterpart of that means that you will ought to be very reliable. Our industry is all about deadlines, and of course, we strive to produce top quality publications. We also expect you to be honest about your progress.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I agree 100%.", "id": 2, "time": "20500", "image": "engenn10le06ob04re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Next, we should talk about establishing an appropriate work schedule. For us, that means being punctual, usually arriving no later than 9:00 a.m. There may be some flexibility, but as a rule of thumb, arriving after 9:00 should be the exception rather than the rule. Most employees don't leave before 5:00 p.m.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: That's great.<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Very good. Now I know this is your first important job, so you ought to think about what it means to behave professionally.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Did I choose the wrong shoes?<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: No, you're fine. I mean things like you shouldn't spread gossip or accumulate absences.  Mr. Brody told you about the importance of your attendance record?<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Yes, he did mention it.<br><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Good.", "id": 3, "time": "57000", "image": "engenn10le06ob04re2img07.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can explain a work policy."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about expectations for the future."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can know what sounds make up the words."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " A \u201ccompany policy\u201d is a set of rules that employees are supposed to follow at work. What are some policies you have to follow at work?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What policies do you not agree with? Why?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "conte